    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41650" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχορεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dance to</i> or <i>in honour of</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				1317
			</span></i> ; <i>come dancing on,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				9.4
			</span></i> ; comically of dishes brought to table, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄριστον ἐπεχόρευσεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.
					44.1
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὸ μέσον ἐ. σαπέρδης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					64.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>add a chorus</i> or <i>choral song,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοιοῦτό τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					5.14
				</span></i>
			.</div>
